---                 North
---     45°           0°           315°
---       \    .- - - - - - -.    /
---          X                 X
---        .'   \           /   '.
---       |        \     /        |
--- West  |           X           |  East
---       |        /     \        |
---        '.   /           \   .'
---          X                 X
---       /    '- - - - - - -'    \
